{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8ebaaebc-6e82-80db-a48a-0b5530e5d8a5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T12:20:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Happy Christmas Eve, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. This is Beatriz Morales. I have three things. First, I need to change my mailing address on the water and sewer account. Second, I want to go paperless. Third, I need a copy of my latest bill sent by email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:16:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, we can do all three. Let me pull up your account. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "13 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Morales, 13 Harrison. And where do you want the bills mailed now, or is it going to email only?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, first, the mailing address should be a P.O. box, not the house. The bills keep sitting in a mailbox that I only check on weekends. Second, once it's changed, I want no paper at all. Email only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Go ahead with the P.O. box, and I'll type it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's P.O. Box 4410, Newport, Rhode Island, zero two eight four zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Box 4410, Newport, 02840. Perfect. And what email do you want for the paperless?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one I use for the house. B Morales, the letter B, then Morales, M-O-R-A-L-E-S, at a mail dot com, and I'm only saying that so you can type it. Can you read it back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "B, M-O-R-A-L-E-S, at a mail dot com. That's what I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll set it to paperless. Just so you know, that switch can take a billing cycle to kick in, so you might still get one more paper bill in the mail. It'll go to the new P.O. box though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's, um, a little annoying, but fine. Now the copy. Can you send the current bill to that email today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send a duplicate right now. Give me a second. [pause] There, it's on its way. Should show up in a few minutes. Check spam if it doesn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. One more question, and it's the one I care about. First, the bill is due, I think, tomorrow or the day after. Second, you're closed tomorrow for the holiday. Third, I'm on the phone all day long. I'm a dispatcher for a plumber, so I can't get to City Hall during hours. If I drop a payment in the box tonight, does it count as on time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a good question. There's a payment drop box at City Hall, and a check in there is generally treated as paid on the day it's collected, not the day it's dropped. With the holiday, that'd be the next business day. If your due date lands inside that gap, I'd note it on the account so there's a record you tried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it might not count. That's, honestly, a hassle. Is there anything online instead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:19:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can pay online through the city's website with a card or bank account, any hour, and it's stamped with the day you submit it. That's your safest bet tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. First, I'll do it online. Second, I'll still drop a check if I can't. Third, can you put the note on the account anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. I'm adding a note now that you contacted us on the twenty-fourth about timing. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Morales. Merry Christmas, and watch for that email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
